---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TriviumCard from '../../components/TriviumCard.astro';
import InfosCard from '../../components/InfosCard.astro';
import PiariumCard from '../../components/PiariumCard.astro';
---

<Layout
  description="浏览 Astrmira 的开源项目：TriviumDB 数据库、infOS AI 伙伴运行时与 Piarium Agent Harness，了解研究如何转化为可以使用的系统。"
  title="Projects · 项目方向 — Astrmira 幻梦星芒"
  route="projects"
>
<div class="wrap"><section class="page-title"><p class="eyebrow">PROJECTS / OPEN SOURCE</p><h1>Ideas,<br><em>made tangible.</em></h1><p>从 TriviumDB 的数据内核、infOS 的智能伙伴，到 Piarium 的 Agent Harness，把研究写进可以使用的系统。</p></section><section class="directory-content" data-project-directory><div class="directory-toolbar"><div class="filters" aria-label="筛选项目"><button class="filter-button" data-project-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">全部项目</button><button class="filter-button" data-project-filter="data" aria-pressed="false">数据系统</button><button class="filter-button" data-project-filter="agents" aria-pressed="false">Agent</button><button class="filter-button" data-project-filter="harness" aria-pressed="false">Agent Harness</button></div><p class="tiny-note" data-project-count aria-live="polite">3 项</p></div><div class="project-grid"><TriviumCard /><InfosCard /><PiariumCard /></div><div class="archive-note"><div><h2>研究与产品之间，<br>是一条双向的路。</h2></div><p>研究为系统提供新方法，真实场景为研究带来新问题。</p></div></section></div><section class="wrap"><div class="collaborate-block"><div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:18px">LET’S ASK THE NEXT QUESTION</p><h2>下一个值得研究的问题，<br>也许来自你。</h2><p>数据库与智能系统 · 科研合作 · 高校联合研究<br>从一个真实的问题，开始一次有意义的合作。</p></div><a href="/collaborate/" data-route="collaborate" class="button button-primary" >联系我们 <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Layout>
